chest as everything she was trying to hold in boiled over.
“You’re the worst thing that ever happened to me! I wish I never met
you. You ruined my life—and my family’s! If it wasn’t for you, I—”
He grasped her shoulders and gave her a shake to jolt her out of her
hysteria. “If it wasn’t for me, your sisters would have lost Hennessy & Co
