For a moment, she was stunned speechless, and then she stomped his
foot with her boot. His face contorted and he staggered back. She tried to
put distance between them, but he held on, which got him three kicks to his
shin.
“You egotistical, conniving, cold-blooded fuck face—Oof.”
Her rant ended on a grunt as he tossed her over his shoulder and strode
