That truth made her thrash so wildly that he staggered.
“I didn’t know you were a psychopath! You only showed me what you
wanted me to see! You had no right to rip my world apart and tear my life to
shreds—”
She screamed as he tipped her off his shoulder. She fell through empty
air and landed on her back with enough force that she lay there, stunned, for
